    "excerpt": "Saltmere Tides Spring tides at Saltmere reach 5.2 metres, two days after the full and new moon. Neap tides Neap tides rise to 3.9 metres; berth 3 still dries at low water. Moorings Visitors' moorings are the yellow buoys east of the ferry pier.",
